sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as Sending Agent
    participant Router as Inter-Agent Message Router
    participant Receiver as Receiving Agent

    Sender->>Router: POST Message Payload (Signed message_id & tenant_id)
    Router->>Router: Verify Sender Signature & Receiver Capability Scope
    Router->>Receiver: Deliver Authorized Payload
    Receiver-->>Router: Acknowledge Message Receipt
